---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About the Developer | Bare Bones SEO" description="Meet Aaron Charlton, founder of Charlton Digital and developer of the free, open-source Bare Bones SEO tools.">
  <section class="wrap about">
    <a class="back" href="/">← Bare Bones SEO</a>
    <h1>About the developer</h1>
    <p class="lead">I'm Aaron Charlton, founder of <a href="https://charltondigital.com/">Charlton Digital</a> and the developer of Bare Bones SEO.</p>
    <p>I've spent about two decades working in search marketing and website development. My work has included helping businesses improve their visibility in search, building websites, and researching marketing. I also hold a PhD in marketing.</p>
    <p>I built Bare Bones SEO because managing fundamental technical SEO settings shouldn't require a heavy optimization suite. Website owners and SEOs should be able to see the settings that matter, change them, and verify what their websites actually publish.</p>
    <p>The project has two open-source approaches: a lightweight <a href="/wordpress/">WordPress plugin</a> and a set of <a href="/ai-sites/">standards for AI-built websites</a> that work with existing coding agents. Neither is intended to replace SEO strategy or content decisions.</p>
    <p>I'm based near Flagstaff, Arizona. You can learn more about my work at <a href="https://aaroncharlton.com/">aaroncharlton.com</a>, visit <a href="https://charltondigital.com/">Charlton Digital</a>, or explore the code on <a href="https://github.com/charltondigital">GitHub</a>.</p>
  </section>
</Base>
<style>
  .about{max-width:52rem;padding-block:var(--space-5) var(--space-6)}
  .back{display:inline-block;margin-bottom:var(--space-3);font-size:.92rem;color:var(--ink-soft)}
  h1{font-size:clamp(2.1rem,4.4vw,3.3rem);margin-bottom:var(--space-3)}
  p{color:var(--ink-soft);margin-bottom:1.2rem}
  .lead{font-size:1.2rem;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.6}
</style>
